  "document_notes": [
    "Workflow order is fixed: D01 take deposit slip → D02 fill account number → D03 enter deposit amount → D04 submit slip with cash.",
    "The customer sentence “Account number fill malthaand, nana dada malpodu?” indicates the account-number field is completed and maps to D03.",
    "The customer sentence “Yan deposit malpuna amount bareye?” asks about the amount field and maps to D03.",
    "The customer sentence “Slip pura fill malthaand next dada malpodu?” indicates the slip is complete and maps to D04.",
    "The D04 assistant Tulu phrase “Slip Boka amount n korle.” was supplied by the user as the confirmed wording for the final submission instruction.",
    "Record each customer variation as its own CUSTOMER WAV. Record one ASSISTANT WAV per assistant step.",
    "Do not add a customer-name or signature instruction to this deposit workflow; neither appears in the supplied deposit.json steps.",
    "Assistant audio files",
    "D01_ASSISTANT.wav · D02_ASSISTANT.wav · D03_ASSISTANT.wav · D04_ASSISTANT.wav"
  ],
